  "project_description": "Node Menu Placer provides a new UI to facilitate the quick placement of nodes in complex menu structures. This module works with the Menu Link Weight module to update the menu settings of the node form.\n\n Features \n Make it easier and faster to place nodes in complex menu structures from the node form.\n\n Post-Installation \n Make sure a content type is configured with available menus in menu settings, the node menu settings section will now have Move to buttons.\n\n Additional Requirements \n Menu Link Weight \n\n Similar projects \n The Menu Position module provides automated menu placement functionality based on rules.\n\n Back to top",
